{"material_id":"mat_fce8a2362be6","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"tl8v9gto8rd3e4x40xfbljj13","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"英国 AI Security Institute：Blog（网页）","author_followers":null,"title":"AISI 红队论文：攻击策略选择会让 LLM 监视器评估结果失真","excerpt":"英国 AI Security Institute 发布论文，测试合成攻击生成方式对监视器评估的影响。评估一个 OpenAI 前生产监视器时，同一监视器对不同攻击策略的漏报率从 0.2%（基础提示）到 23%（转录编辑）不等，优化程度也会显著改变结果。作者指出合成转录只是真实有害行为代理，其代表性难以证明，仅凭监视器评估不足以保证部署安全，需辅以能力限制、人工在环和沙箱等分层防护。","source_url":"https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/attack-policy-selection-can-make-monitor-evaluations-misleading","canonical_url":"https://www.aisi.gov.uk/blog/attack-policy-selection-can-make-monitor-evaluations-misleading","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-24T10:44:37.141Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold","low_level_only"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"英国 AI Security Institute：Blog（网页）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_news","low_level_research"],"relevance_score":5,"freshness_score":80,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":40,"fingerprint":"fce8a2362be6589716c8f6f5ac33c5c499d09a59c47e025d6f921c883982e900","content_fingerprint":"7bdb58fa2eabd3997b8857439e7802de87d66c9df36bb482275d50a200e4463e"}
{"material_id":"mat_36fb5b1c7a9f","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"gj8mzwrgqlkvim6xe382a35q2","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","author_followers":null,"title":"Anthropic 访谈 58 家企业客户：AI 采用的价值、雇佣影响与组织重组","excerpt":"Anthropic 研究团队对 58 家企业客户进行 66 次面对面访谈，分析企业采用 AI 的方式、瓶颈与组织变化。研究发现多数 AI 应用通过扩大产出而非削减成本创造价值；直接裁员案例很少，但约三分之二的公司因 AI 减少招聘，九家削减外包和离岸承包商；高价值应用通常需要更深度的组织重组，如拓宽岗位职责、把员工转向 AI 无法完成的瓶颈任务，以及为非技术员工建设数据和基础设施支持。","source_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/working-with-ai","canonical_url":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/working-with-ai","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-22T16:00:00.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-24T10:44:37.141Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news","application_case"],"relevance_score":40,"freshness_score":80,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":58,"fingerprint":"36fb5b1c7a9ff4c850f964edd0162f1408c9ecdd1aa74ccb8f6a1549c82ca1ea","content_fingerprint":"2bfae0c5b5041e5d880fbece90ef4fbedc80d823bad85d883df4c9e43fc922bd"}
