{"material_id":"mat_65ca066ee34d","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"ajcxs84uezjqgsgxpdtr31o0l","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：X.PIN (@thexpin)","author_followers":null,"title":"NVIDIA 宣布黄仁勋复任总裁兼 CEO 并重回董事会","excerpt":"NVIDIA 于 11 月 23 日宣布黄仁勋即刻复任总裁、CEO 及董事会成员，董事会一致投票通过，临时 CEO Colette Kress 继续担任 CFO。复职决定参考了美国政府高层意见，董事会认为其不构成国家安全风险，此前因黄仁勋成为外国情报行动目标而启动的独立董事调查将继续进行，董事会另设国家安全与出口管制委员会并招聘首席合规官。","source_url":"https://x.com/thexpin/status/2124866686025400819","canonical_url":"https://x.com/thexpin/status/2124866686025400819","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:04:30.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-24T10:44:37.141Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：X.PIN (@thexpin)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"65ca066ee34dfeeddf76059be8fdd7071196ddf1dd8cfcc4fe499dcb0bfe6ace","content_fingerprint":"490b7a8a3dfefe79e40b58b8e63f9ef443d6a25f80cd3208d9f32c68e7c120bb"}
{"material_id":"mat_503e7841485b","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"gl6fl6hsisrt26tg83li0j4gk","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","author_followers":null,"title":"ChatGPT 推出面向日常对话优化的 GPT-6.2 Sol","excerpt":"ChatGPT 宣布在 Chat 标签页推出面向日常对话优化的 GPT-6.2 Sol，今日起面向 Plus、Pro、Business 和 Enterprise 用户开放。该版本更擅长处理复杂请求和在线信息查找，能识别照片中标签文字、路牌符号等细节，并更好地根据价格、位置等偏好缩小选项范围。转发者 Tibo 表示答案质量会有明显提升，年底前应用体验还会更快、更简洁。","source_url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2124998553856844186","canonical_url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2124998553856844186","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-23T22:48:30.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-24T10:44:37.141Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_basics","ai_news"],"relevance_score":35,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":60,"fingerprint":"503e7841485bef746eff1540c0b8850e5cd3335174b1a022f096dab5f0b2a5bb","content_fingerprint":"1e31ba14960f28e89e1adc0d878a198abf097c5377d953f4221818e6ad33f639"}
